# Bruno API collection

Source of truth for interactive API requests: `bruno/` (plain-text `.bru` files, committed to git). Never use Postman exports or ignore Bruno under `.gitignore`.

## When to update (mandatory)

After **creating or changing** any HTTP endpoint (`@RestController` / `@*Mapping` under `adapter/in/web`):

1. Add or update the matching `.bru` request under `bruno/`.
2. Keep folder layout aligned with the URL after `/api/v1/`  
   (e.g. `POST /api/v1/auth/customer/send-otp` → `bruno/auth/customer/send-otp.bru`).
3. Update request method, URL (`{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/...`), headers, body (snake_case JSON), auth, and docs to match the controller + DTOs + story error codes.
4. Delete obsolete `.bru` files when an endpoint is removed or renamed.
5. Do this in the **same change** as the Java endpoint — not a follow-up.

## Required scripts (automate internally)

Every request `.bru` must include:

| Block | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `script:pre-request` | Resolve vars (IDs, tokens, magic OTP phone); set auth/`Idempotency-Key` when needed |
| `script:post-response` | Persist useful fields to env (`bru.setEnvVar`) for downstream requests |
| `tests` | Assert status + `ApiResponse` / `ApiError` envelope (`success`, `data` or `error.code`) |

Collection defaults live in `bruno/collection.bru` (shared headers / envelope helpers). Prefer inheriting auth (`auth: inherit`) and only override per request.

Auth token flow: login/OTP verify requests write `accessToken` / `refreshToken` / `sessionId`; protected requests read `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`.

Public endpoints: `auth: none`. Protected: bearer from env. Webhooks: no bearer; document HMAC headers in scripts/docs.

## Environments

- `bruno/environments/Local.bru` — `baseUrl: http://localhost:8080`
- `bruno/environments/Staging.bru` — `baseUrl: https://staging-core.api.nammamedmate.com`
- `bruno/environments/Prod.bru` — `baseUrl: https://core.api.nammamedmate.com`
- Mark secrets with `vars:secret` (`accessToken`, `refreshToken`, etc.). Never commit real production secrets.
- Keep placeholders empty for tokens and credentials; fill only in the Bruno UI (not in git).

## Done check

Endpoint PR/story is incomplete until `bruno/` reflects the contract and scripts chain the happy path without manual copy-paste.
